1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:45,719
Commander He.

17
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,399
The Rongs have money and goods.

18
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,159
Whatever you want, we can talk.

19
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:50,359
Just let us go.

20
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,039
All right.

21
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,320
Let's talk.

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,799
How about this?

23
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,079
I'll give you two choices.

24
00:01:00,119 --> 00:01:01,000
First,

25
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,759
kill her yourself,

26
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:04,920
and I'll send you back to Lancheng.

27
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,120
Second...

28
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,120
I'll take the second.

29
00:01:10,079 --> 00:01:11,719
(He's been pampered his whole life.)

30
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:13,280
(He's never faced a scare like this.)

31
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,000
(Once he hears both choices,)

32
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,959
(he'll definitely save himself first.)

33
00:01:17,319 --> 00:01:18,599
(He'll definitely choose the first.)

34
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,239
Yutang.

35
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:29,760
I'll protect you, no matter what.

36
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:34,080
=Episode 21=

37
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:35,480
Young Master Rong.

38
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:38,159
You really are a man
worth spending her life with.

39
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,120
The second choice.

40
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:45,079
I need you to write
your father a letter.

41
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:48,920
Say you've caught a cold

42
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,480
and need to rest in Fancheng
for a few days before leaving.

43
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:54,359
But you and Ms. Lu are in love

44
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:55,200
and got carried away.

45
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,680
You've already slept together.

46
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,519
The governor is very displeased

47
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,359
and thinks your family disrespected him.

48
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:04,359
So he wants your father
to ship the goods first

49
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:05,319
as a show of good faith.

50
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,520
Quite a scheme, Commander He.

51
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:11,360
You haven't even paid us,

52
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,400
yet you want the Rongs to ship first.

53
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,159
You want our goods for nothing.

54
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,560
Then how about this?

55
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,759
I'll send you home now.

56
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,439
Forget the deal.

57
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,879
You won't lose anything,

58
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,560
right?

59
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:27,960
No.

60
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,800
I'll write it. I'll write it.

61
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,080
Young Master Rong.

62
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,039
Young Master Rong.

63
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,719
We're not officially married yet.

64
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,680
You don't have to do this.

65
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,199
From the moment I saw you,

66
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,520
I knew you were the one.

67
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,120
I'll live and die with you.

68
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,960
(Was all this really necessary?)

69
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:01,360
(I didn't expect
this to get so complicated.)

70
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,639
Send it out immediately.

71
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,159
Don't worry, Young Master Rong.

72
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,560
Once the goods arrive,

73
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,120
we'll send you home at once.

74
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,360
Young Master Rong, time to eat.

75
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:24,599
What about Yutang?

76
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,800
Commander He said

77
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,560
Lu Zhentian and his daughter
don't need to eat.

78
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,960
Young Master Rong, you're our guest,

79
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:29,840
so you're different.

80
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,439
He Jingchen.

81
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,960
Commander He, what are you doing?

82
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:42,159
She used to hide behind her father

83
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,520
and humiliate me over and over.

84
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,120
Can't I pay her back in kind?

85
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,960
You can't break your word, Commander He!

86
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:48,719
I'm after her body,

87
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:49,680
not her life.

88
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,039
How is that breaking my word?

89
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:51,520
Come on.

90
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:51,960
Let go of me!

91
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,520
Commander He!

92
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,919
Please don't touch her!

93
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:54,919
We can still negotiate!

94
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:56,080
Whatever you want, we can talk!

95
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,520
He Jingchen!

96
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,800
Don't you touch her!

97
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,360
He Jingchen!

98
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,879
He Jingchen, what are you doing?

99
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:02,360
Young Master Rong!

100
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,159
Young Master Rong, save me!

101
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,240
That should do it.

102
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,360
You've worked hard for so long.

103
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,840
You must be starving.

104
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,479
He Jingchen.

105
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:15,960
You're quite the actor, huh?

106
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:17,360
I picked up a thing or two from you.

107
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,959
After all,
I've been around you long enough.

108
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,240
Besides,

109
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,160
I couldn't just leave you

110
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,000
sleeping next to those two creeps.

111
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,800
This place may be rough,

112
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:31,240
but at least you have a bed and bedding.

113
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:35,920
Once I rescue the governor and Ms. Lu

114
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:37,879
from these bandits,

115
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,480
we'll be living the good life.

116
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,639
Is Ms. Lu asleep?

117
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,000
How could she sleep?

118
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,160
You men have tough skin.

119
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:12,120
But Ms. Lu's skin is delicate.

120
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,360
In a place like this,

121
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,879
the mosquitoes will feast on her.

122
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,340
♪I secretly take your♪

123
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,640
♪Old hairpin and repaint it♪

124
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,080
♪Imagining your smile♪

125
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,400
♪Ripples stir within my heart♪

126
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,000
♪Dreaming that someday♪

127
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,400
♪I'll pin up your hair for you♪

128
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:51,000
♪And tell you of my love♪

129
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,800
♪I long to take you to see♪

130
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:55,320
♪The Qixi shadow-puppet show♪

131
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,400
♪Your favorite...♪

132
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:59,160
♪Rouge compact, placed in your hand♪

133
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:00,480
Sorry.

134
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,600
I brought some herbs
to repel mosquitoes.

135
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,800
♪The chill as rain begins to fall♪

136
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:09,880
♪You slip beneath my paper umbrella♪

137
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,800
♪And lean close by my side♪

138
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:17,240
♪At just the right angle♪

139
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,720
♪I catch the scent of your hair♪

140
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:22,560
♪Clouds veil the moonlight for a moment♪

141
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:27,040
♪My heartbeat suddenly feels more real♪

142
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:33,520
♪Hand in hand through Jiangnan lanes♪

143
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:37,480
♪Hearing night rain on a painted boat♪

144
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:40,880
♪Where you and I first met♪

145
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,720
♪How deep have these feelings grown?♪

146
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,760
♪Music from the black-canopied boat♪

147
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:49,400
♪Deepening the sorrow of parting♪

148
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,600
The herbs may not work.

149
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,399
I'll stay and keep mosquitoes away.

150
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,040
Would that be okay?

151
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:56,640
♪The rain falls as the wind goes still♪

152
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,320
♪If I bring up the past again♪

153
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,840
♪Our carefree childhood days together♪

154
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:03,960
♪Would you mind if I called it love?♪

155
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:08,000
♪I couldn't help but fall for you♪

156
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:27,400
♪You slip beneath my paper umbrella♪

157
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:30,400
♪And lean close by my side♪

158
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:34,640
♪At just the right angle♪

159
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:37,400
♪I catch the scent of your hair♪

160
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:44,959
Yutang.

161
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,160
No.

162
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,759
He Jingchen, you brute!

163
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,560
How could you do this to her?

164
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,959
Come out here!

165
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:54,759
He Jingchen!

166
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:57,000
Get out here!

167
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:00,120
Young Master Rong, calm down.

168
00:08:00,639 --> 00:08:01,959
At this point,

169
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,480
angering him won't do you any good.

170
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:05,879
How could he do this to you?

171
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,040
Young Master Rong.

172
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,920
It seems fate brought us together
only to keep us apart.

173
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,480
I'm no longer worthy of you.

174
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:13,839
One day, when you're free,

175
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:15,639
find someone else.

176
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,160
No.

177
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,240
I don't care.

178
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,279
I only want you.

179
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,800
Commander He.

180
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,480
Don't worry.

181
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,279
I have another plan.

182
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,840
What's your bad idea this time?

183
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,879
This one isn't bad, I promise.

184
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,919
The Rongs of Lancheng

185
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:40,559
are famously conservative.

186
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:44,159
If that boy finds out Ms. Lu
is no longer a virgin,

187
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,519
he'll definitely mind

188
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:47,080
and cast her aside in disgust.

189
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:52,200
Commander He,
why don't you take Ms. Lu tonight and...

190
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:55,039
I mean, pretend!

191
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:55,840
Pretend.

192
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:09,840
If you suggest one more plan,

193
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:11,759
kill yourself on the spot.

194
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,679
Commander He.

195
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,679
I think it'll be hard

196
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:17,879
to ruin Ms. Lu's image

197
00:09:18,799 --> 00:09:19,600
in that boy's eyes.

198
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,240
Still, I have to say,

199
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:31,279
the marks on you and Ms. Lu

200
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,639
look pretty convincing.

201
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,559
Don't touch her!

202
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,600
I said don't touch her!

203
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:51,960
Where are you taking her?

204
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,360
Where are you taking me?

205
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:54,360
Young Master Rong!

206
00:09:54,519 --> 00:09:54,919
Young Master Rong!

207
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:55,960
Where's He Jingchen?

208
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,480
- He Jingchen, get out here!
- (Young Master Rong)

209
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,559
Yutang.

210
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:14,679
Yutang, don't be afraid.

211
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,480
I don't want to go!

212
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,399
Yutang, don't be afraid.

213
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,480
He Jingchen, you brute!

214
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,559
Get out here!

215
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,919
Get out here!

216
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:20,879
He Jingchen!

217
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:35,960
Yutang.

218
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,799
Please, let her go!

219
00:10:37,799 --> 00:10:39,320
Please, let her go!

220
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,519
She's innocent!

221
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,360
Yutang!

222
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,639
Yutang!

223
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:45,960
He Jingchen!

224
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,159
Are you an animal?

225
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,960
At least I'm not a pretty boy like him.

226
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,519
He's all talk.

227
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:55,279
(Boss, the goods are here.)

228
00:10:58,759 --> 00:11:00,360
You've had a rough few days, Ms. Lu.

229
00:11:00,679 --> 00:11:01,639
Tonight,

230
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:02,759
get a good night's sleep.

231
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:28,120
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

232
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:32,760
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

233
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,920
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

234
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,440
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

235
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:42,800
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

236
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:48,760
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

237
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:53,480
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

238
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:56,960
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

239
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,280
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

240
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:02,520
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

241
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:09,200
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

242
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,800
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

243
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:16,000
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

244
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:22,520
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

245
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,920
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

246
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:29,240
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

247
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:32,080
♪Boundless♪
